     1,
     "Greetings all, <div><br></div><div>Below is an amalgamation of funding and engagement opportunities for PIs, FIs, and students here at NASA (resources compiled and shared from the perspective of a a wildlife ecologist). Please share widely.</div><div><br></div><div>The deadline for proposal submissions approaches for NASA Ecological Conservation Applications Area&#39;s <a href=\"http://bit.ly/nasa-ecol-open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://bit.ly/nasa-ecol-open&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033129000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3KpZuiwoP_IkCNKeTiQ-3K\">A.40: EARTH SCIENCE APPLICATIONS: ECOLOGICAL CONSERVATION.</a> Solicitation seeks proposal for <b><i><u>applications</u></i></b> of remote sensing for conservation in the following topics: <b>invasion ecology; protected areas; ecosystem services</b>. Link to full solicitation: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/nasa-ecol-open\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bit.ly/nasa-ecol-open&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1CQljVqwUponuFmicfplXV\">https://bit.ly/nasa-ecol-open</a>. <div><br></div><div>For more information on the NASA Biodiversity &amp; EcoCons programs, see <a href=\"https://bit.ly/nasa-bdec\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bit.ly/nasa-bdec&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2A17CeCpPdNhfTPOZlqAy0\">https://bit.ly/nasa-bdec</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>NASA also offers several, arguably well-paid, semester-long <b><u>internships</u></b> across the agency. Eligibility for current or past undergraduate and graduate STEM students (<a href=\"https://intern.nasa.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://intern.nasa.gov/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1C5DN6qAnwqdXxWFSOqNxf\">https://intern.nasa.gov/</a>). <i>Note:</i> the Ecol. Cons. applications area at HQ seeks 1 intern for this summer. <a href=\"https://stemgateway.nasa.gov/public/s/explore-opportunities/internships\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stemgateway.nasa.gov/public/s/explore-opportunities/internships&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19qsFgHoa_a12jJiaondTH\">Full list of openings are here</a>  (see &#39;<a title=\"Biological Diversity &amp; Ecological Forecasting Program Support\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://stemgateway.nasa.gov/public/s/course-offering/a0Bt000000AUwQAEA1/biological-diversity-ecological-forecasting-program-support\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;max-height:4.5em;font-family:&quot;Ek Mukta&quot;;font-size:13px;display:inline\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stemgateway.nasa.gov/public/s/course-offering/a0Bt000000AUwQAEA1/biological-diversity-ecological-forecasting-program-support&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0TmTN5vezoJobiV0Ulic-6\">Biological Diversity &amp; Ecological Forecasting Program Support</a>&#39; for our programs&#39; HQ remote position). BioSCape, one of our field projects with airborne support, project <a href=\"https://stemgateway.nasa.gov/public/s/course-offering/a0Bt000000AUwPqEAL/bioscape-communications-internship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stemgateway.nasa.gov/public/s/course-offering/a0Bt000000AUwPqEAL/bioscape-communications-internship&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw32dpBEEVX5DNVyp5pLvFXG\">seeks a student to help with comms</a>.  <br></div><div><br></div><div>Please also see <a href=\"https://bit.ly/nasa-wildlife\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bit.ly/nasa-wildlife&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CZZfcVFWT5FyTx-OMvaEp\">here </a>(<a href=\"https://bit.ly/nasa-wildlife\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bit.ly/nasa-wildlife&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CZZfcVFWT5FyTx-OMvaEp\">https://bit.ly/nasa-wildlife</a>) for a dynamic and informal list of wildlife/conservation-relevant information, opportunities, programs, and missions. Feel free to post ?s or comments on the sheets or the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1qHRa3kPa46BruwAOSE5hZCIRxKoWEucKebQJJAPsr-s/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1qHRa3kPa46BruwAOSE5hZCIRxKoWEucKebQJJAPsr-s/edit?usp%3Dsharing&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Rs366iyLTgUXOsU0drX2t\">&#39;open forum&#39; gsheet.</a> </div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div></div><div> </div><div><br></div><div><p><b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(89,89,89)\">Jessica\r\n  L. Burnett, Ph.D.</span></b><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(89,89,89)\"> (<i>she/her)<br></i></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\">AAAS Science &amp; Technology Policy Fellow<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\">Ecological\r\n  Conservation Applications Area<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\">Earth Science Division | Science Mission Directorate<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\"><br>Mary W. Jackson NASA Headquarters Building<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\">300 Hidden Figures Way SW<br></span><span style=\"color:rgb(89,89,89);font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\">Washington\r\n  D.C. 20546<br></span><span style=\"font-family:Roboto;font-size:9pt\"><font color=\"#595959\"><a href=\"tel:(202)%20209-5125\" value=\"+12022095125\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">202.209.5125</a> (C)<br></font></span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(5,99,193)\">jessica.burnett @<a href=\"http://nasa.gov\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://nasa.gov&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1IlGxP8DvNs5uUkSPmzttg\">nasa.gov</a></span></p><span border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:5.9pt;border-collapse:collapse\"><span style=\"min-height:17.3pt\"><span width=\"533\" style=\"width:399.95pt;border-top:1pt solid white;border-right:1pt solid white;border-bottom:1pt solid white;border-left:none;padding:0in 5.4pt;min-height:17.3pt\">\r\n  <p style=\"line-height:11.55pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\"> </span></p>\r\n  <p style=\"line-height:11.55pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\">*I live and work on\r\n  the ancestral, traditional and contemporary lands of the </span></i><a href=\"https://www.piscatawaytribe.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.piscatawaytribe.org/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1UJOAOr-uZVXFkTg2n829p\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(5,99,193)\">Piscataway</span></i></a><i><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\"> (the people where the rivers blend) and\r\n  the ancestral lands of the </span></i><a href=\"https://www.washingtonpost.com/history/2018/11/22/native-american-tribe-once-called-dc-home-its-had-no-living-members-centuries/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.washingtonpost.com/history/2018/11/22/native-american-tribe-once-called-dc-home-its-had-no-living-members-centuries/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449033130000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0b0xv0QW_OZOLkwgSa_RcS\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(5,99,193)\">Nacotchtank</span></i></a><i><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\">.</span></i><u><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\"> </span></u><i><span style=\"font-size:8pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\">  </span></i><i><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-family:Roboto;color:rgb(64,64,64)\"></span></i></p>\r\n  </span>\r\n  \r\n </span>\r\n</span>\r\n\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto;color:white\"><br>\r\n<br>\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;font-family:Roboto\"></span></p></div>"
